  },
  {
   "id": "note-gdn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": -364,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 250,
   "text": "**Gated DeltaNet rows** (45): linear attention. Each layer keeps one recurrent state [64 heads × 128 × 128] = 1 048 576 values, the same size at token 10 or token 262 144 — no KV cache that grows with T. Short causal conv (kernel 4) on q/k/v, per-head decay and write strength (β)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-full",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1060,
   "y": -364,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 250,
   "text": "**Gated attention rows** (15, L3, L7, …): softmax attention, GQA 32 query : 2 KV heads × 256, a sigmoid output gate per channel, RoPE on 64 of 256 dims. Only these layers cache K/V: 1 024 values per token each."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-moe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": -74,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "**MoE in every layer**: softmax router over 512 experts → top-10, weights renormalised. Expert = SwiGLU 4096→1024→4096 (12.6M). Shared expert (same width) is added through a sigmoid gate. Per token: 10 + 1 experts of 512 → ~2.1% of FFN weights."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-norm",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1060,
   "y": -74,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "Pre-norm residual blocks; RMSNorm is zero-centred (scale = 1 + w). q/k get their own per-head RMSNorm in the attention layers."
  },
  {
   "id": "img8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**image / video** frames",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "patch9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -541,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 123,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1090,
   "y": -874,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`patches [P, 1536]  (2×16×16×3)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "vit11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -810,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**ViT ×27** (+ learned pos-embed)  \n415.9M · width 1152",
   "color": "#a78bfa"
  },
  {
   "id": "vf12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -526,
   "y": -714,
   "width": 92,
